Date: Sat, 26 Sep 2026 18:38:09 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tboir: add Character Keys, boss character logic and Item Keys

For the AP Character Lock companion mod:
- character_keys: adds Character Key 1..N (up to 60) as progression items.
- boss_character_keys: bosses that only count with some characters; their
  reward checks and goal require one of the matching Character Keys in
  logic, so a key can never end up behind its own boss.
- item_keys: collectibles locked until "Item Key: <name>" is received.

New items are appended at the end of the item list, so existing item IDs
are unchanged. Options are also sent in slot data for the mod.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
